    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Shoots straight on the point, should use FOV 90 and input.sensitivity 0.66

Personally used Settings:

Driver should be turned on to be more legit.
Snap to Window is turned off
You should set these in-game /// FOV (graphics.fov 90 in F1) and Sensitivity (input.sensitivity 0.66 in F1)
Mouse used: Trust GXT 105  ///   DPI: 1600
if possible put it on Mouse Button 1 (Left Click)


Personally used Key Settings:

Use minimal delay when pressing keys in macros: ON
React only to physical clicks on keyboards and mice: ON
Block modifier keystrokes: ON

</Description>
